// The timers (sea/Support/Timer.h) on a fake clock: the printed form of a
// duration, accumulation and counts, scopes with an early return and nested
// into --mlir-timing, a run's timers in first-use order with their keys and
// laps.
RUN: sea-timer-test | FileCheck %s
CHECK: text: ok
CHECK: stopwatch: ok
CHECK: timer: ok
CHECK: scope: ok
CHECK: group: ok
CHECK: system: ok
CHECK: failures: 0

